{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Reinforcing Loop.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Reinforcing Loop.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"reinforcing loop reinforcing loop","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Reinforcing Loop.md","fileName":"Reinforcing Loop.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Reinforcing Loop","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 14:36\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[System Dynamics]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["System Dynamics","Progression System","Play Space","Balancing Loop","advancedgamedesign.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Reinforcing Loop.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Reinforcing Loop.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"reinforcing loop reinforcing loop","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Reinforcing Loop.md","fileName":"Reinforcing Loop.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Reinforcing Loop","heading":"Reinforcing Loop","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A reinforcing loop amplifies the direction of change already occurring in a system. The reinforced quality may be desirable or harmful: growth, learning, disease spread, and accumulating advantage can share the same structure.\n\nIn games, reinforcing loops support gain and [[Progression System|progression]], but an unchecked loop can produce a rich-get-richer outcome and collapse the [[Play Space]]. [[Balancing Loop|Balancing loops]] can preserve meaningful competition by limiting runaway divergence.","tags":["baby"],"links":["System Dynamics","Progression System","Play Space","Balancing Loop","advancedgamedesign.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Reinforcing Loop.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Reinforcing Loop.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"reinforcing loop reinforc